---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { TERMS_VERSION } from '../config/commerce';
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping & Delivery | CUMID" description="Shipping & Delivery for CUMID diary purchases and services."><article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 py-12 space-y-7"><header><h1 class="text-4xl mb-4">Shipping & Delivery</h1><p class="text-sm">Effective 22 October 2026 · Version {TERMS_VERSION} · India</p></header>
<section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Delivery scope</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">We accept preorders for serviceable PIN codes in India. Confirm serviceability with us before payment. Enter a complete address and PIN code. We may contact you to resolve courier serviceability before fulfilment. If we cannot deliver an accepted order, we explain the issue and refund it if a suitable alternative is not agreed.</p></section>
<section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Charges and timing</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Shipping is a flat ₹50 per order. Diaries cost ₹149 each: one diary totals ₹199; two total ₹348. Delivery is within 14 calendar days of payment confirmation, including manufacturing and shipping. The timeline begins after we confirm your payment, product specifications and complete delivery address. Preorders are made to order; catalogue images are digital previews.</p></section>
<section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Tracking and delays</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Tracking is added once available from the courier. We communicate material delays, revised estimates and applicable cancellation or refund options. Contact support@cumid.store with your order reference for a lost, delayed or undelivered parcel.</p></section>
<section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Address changes and delivery issues</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Contact us before dispatch if an address needs correction. Changes after dispatch may not be possible. Any proposed extra shipping charge is explained before it is agreed. Report a parcel marked delivered but not received promptly so we can investigate; tracking status alone does not prevent a legitimate claim.</p></section>
<p class="text-sm"><a class="underline" href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a class="underline" href="/returns-cancellations">Returns</a> · <a class="underline" href="/shipping">Shipping</a> · <a class="underline" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></p></article></BaseLayout>
